---
import Base from "../../../layouts/Base.astro";
const effectiveDate = "May 1, 2026";
const lastUpdated = "May 1, 2026";
---

<Base title="Sweepstakes Rules | GoDoDaytona" subtitle="Official rules for the Full Court Giveaway and all future GoDoDaytona sweepstakes and contests." cityBase="daytona">
  <div class="lgWrap">

    <nav class="lgBread" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
      <a href="/daytona/">Home</a>
      <span aria-hidden="true">›</span>
      <a href="/daytona/legal/">Legal</a>
      <span aria-hidden="true">›</span>
      <span>Sweepstakes Rules</span>
    </nav>

    <span class="lgEyebrow">GoDoDaytona</span>
    <h1 class="lgTitle">Sweepstakes Rules</h1>
    <p class="lgSubhead">Full Court Giveaway — Official Rules</p>
    <div class="lgMeta">
      <span>Effective: {effectiveDate}</span>
      <span>Last Updated: {lastUpdated}</span>
    </div>
    <div class="lgDivider"></div>

    <div class="lgNotice">
      <p><strong>NO PURCHASE NECESSARY.</strong> A PURCHASE WILL NOT IMPROVE YOUR CHANCES OF WINNING. These rules apply to all GoDoDaytona sweepstakes unless a specific promotion's published rules state otherwise.</p>
    </div>

    <nav class="lgToc" aria-label="Table of contents">
      <p class="lgTocTitle">Contents</p>
      <ol class="lgTocList">
        <li><a href="#sponsor">1. Sponsor</a></li>
        <li><a href="#eligibility">2. Eligibility</a></li>
        <li><a href="#period">3. Promotion Period</a></li>
        <li><a href="#entry">4. How to Enter</a></li>
        <li><a href="#prizes">5. Prizes</a></li>
        <li><a href="#winner">6. Winner Selection & Notification</a></li>
        <li><a href="#odds">7. Odds of Winning</a></li>
        <li><a href="#acceptance">8. Prize Acceptance & Conditions</a></li>
        <li><a href="#publicity">9. Publicity Consent</a></li>
        <li><a href="#release">10. Release of Liability</a></li>
        <li><a href="#general">11. General Conditions</a></li>
        <li><a href="#disputes">12. Disputes</a></li>
        <li><a href="#contact">13. Sponsor Contact</a></li>
      </ol>
    </nav>

    <div class="lgSection" id="sponsor">
      <h2>1. Sponsor</h2>
      <p>GoDoCity LLC, Daytona Beach, Florida ("Sponsor"). The promotion may be administered with the participation of local business partners who contribute prizes; contributing partners are not co-sponsors and have no administrative authority over the promotion.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="lgSection" id="eligibility">
      <h2>2. Eligibility</h2>
      <p>Promotions are open to legal residents of the United States who are 18 years of age or older at the time of entry, unless the specific promotion's rules state a different age or geographic requirement.</p>
      <p>The following persons are not eligible to enter:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Employees, contractors, and agents of GoDoCity LLC and its affiliates.</li>
        <li>Employees of any prize-contributing partner business.</li>
        <li>Immediate family members (spouse, parent, sibling, child) and household members of any of the above.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>Void where prohibited or restricted by law.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="lgSection" id="period">
      <h2>3. Promotion Period</h2>
      <p>Each GoDoDaytona promotion will specify its own entry start date and time, and entry end date and time, all in Eastern Time. All entries must be received by the stated deadline. Entries received after the stated entry period ends will not be considered. Sponsor's computer system is the official timekeeping device.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="lgSection" id="entry">
      <h2>4. How to Enter</h2>
      <p>Entry methods and requirements are specified in each promotion. Accepted methods may include, but are not limited to:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Online entry form:</strong> Complete and submit the official entry form at the designated GoDoDaytona.com entry page during the promotion period.</li>
        <li><strong>Email entry:</strong> Send an email to the address specified in the promotion with required information in the body.</li>
        <li><strong>Newsletter subscription entry:</strong> Subscribe to the GoDoDaytona newsletter during the promotion period as specified in the promotion details.</li>
        <li><strong>Social media entry:</strong> Follow, like, comment on, or share content from an official GoDoDaytona social account as specified in the promotion.</li>
      </ul>
      <p><strong>Entry limits:</strong> Unless otherwise stated, limit one (1) entry per person per entry method per promotion period. Multiple entries from the same person using different email addresses, accounts, or identities may result in disqualification of all entries from that person. Mass entries, automated entries, entries via scripts or bots, and entries through third-party services are void.</p>
      <p>Entries become the property of Sponsor and will not be returned. Sponsor is not responsible for lost, late, misdirected, damaged, illegible, or incomplete entries.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="lgSection" id="prizes">
      <h2>5. Prizes</h2>
      <p>Prize descriptions and approximate retail values (ARV) are stated in each individual promotion's materials. Unless the promotion specifies otherwise:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>All prizes are awarded "as is" with no warranty, express or implied.</li>
        <li>No prize substitutions, exchanges, or cash equivalents are permitted, except at Sponsor's sole discretion.</li>
        <li>Prizes are non-transferable and non-assignable.</li>
        <li>All federal, state, and local taxes on prizes, and any other costs associated with acceptance or use of a prize, are the sole responsibility of the winner.</li>
        <li>Prizes must be claimed within the timeframe specified in the winner notification. Unclaimed prizes may not be awarded.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="lgSection" id="winner">
      <h2>6. Winner Selection & Notification</h2>
      <p>Winners will be selected as specified in the promotion — either by random drawing from all eligible entries received using a randomization process, or by a judged panel as described in the specific promotion's rules. Drawings and judged selections will occur on or about the date(s) stated in the promotion materials.</p>
      <p>Potential winners will be contacted by Sponsor via the email address provided at entry within five (5) business days of selection. Sponsor will make up to three (3) attempts to contact each potential winner over a period of five (5) days. If a potential winner:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Cannot be reached after three contact attempts,</li>
        <li>Is found to be ineligible,</li>
        <li>Fails to respond within 72 hours of the final notification attempt, or</li>
        <li>Fails to execute required documents within the stated timeframe,</li>
      </ul>
      <p>then that person will be disqualified and an alternate winner may be selected from the remaining eligible entries using the same method.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="lgSection" id="odds">
      <h2>7. Odds of Winning</h2>
      <p>Odds of winning depend on the number of eligible entries received during the promotion period. Sponsor cannot predict the number of entries in advance. Past promotions are not indicative of future odds.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="lgSection" id="acceptance">
      <h2>8. Prize Acceptance & Conditions</h2>
      <p>As a condition of prize award, winners may be required to execute and return the following within 10 days of notification:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>An Affidavit of Eligibility confirming compliance with these Official Rules.</li>
        <li>A Release of Liability.</li>
        <li>A Publicity Release (where permitted by law).</li>
      </ul>
      <p>Failure to execute and return required documents within the specified timeframe may result in disqualification and forfeiture of the prize. If a winner is a minor in their state of residence, a parent or legal guardian may be required to execute documents on their behalf.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="lgSection" id="publicity">
      <h2>9. Publicity Consent</h2>
      <p>Except where prohibited by law, acceptance of a prize constitutes the winner's consent to GoDoCity LLC's use of the winner's name, general location (city/state), likeness, photograph, and statements about the promotion for promotional, advertising, and publicity purposes in any media format — including print, digital, social media, and broadcast — without additional compensation or prior notice.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="lgSection" id="release">
      <h2>10. Release of Liability</h2>
      <p>By entering, each participant agrees to release, indemnify, and hold harmless GoDoCity LLC, its officers, directors, employees, agents, partners, affiliates, and prize-contributing partners from any and all liability for any injury, loss, or damage of any kind arising in whole or in part from:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Participation in the promotion or any promotion-related activity.</li>
        <li>Acceptance, possession, use, or misuse of any prize.</li>
        <li>Any printing or typographical errors in promotion materials.</li>
        <li>Technical failures or interruptions affecting the administration of the promotion.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="lgSection" id="general">
      <h2>11. General Conditions</h2>
      <p>Sponsor reserves the right to cancel, suspend, modify, or terminate any promotion at any time if Sponsor determines, in its sole judgment, that fraud, technical failures, unauthorized human intervention, or any other factor beyond Sponsor's reasonable control has impaired the integrity, fairness, or proper administration of the promotion. In such an event, Sponsor may, at its discretion, award prizes by random drawing from among all eligible, non-suspect entries received prior to the event requiring such action.</p>
      <p>All decisions by Sponsor regarding eligibility, winner selection, prize award, and interpretation of these rules are final and binding. No correspondence will be entered into except as required by applicable law.</p>
      <p>Sponsor is not responsible for any typographical or other errors in the offer or administration of the promotion, including but not limited to errors in advertising, the official rules, the selection and announcement of winners, or the distribution of prizes.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="lgSection" id="disputes">
      <h2>12. Disputes</h2>
      <p>All disputes, claims, and causes of action arising from or related to any GoDoDaytona promotion or these Official Rules shall be resolved individually, without resort to any form of class action or consolidated proceeding. All disputes shall be governed by and construed in accordance with the laws of the State of Florida, without regard to conflict-of-law principles. Any legal action must be filed exclusively in the state or federal courts located in Volusia County, Florida.</p>
      <p>By entering, participants waive the right to seek punitive, incidental, or consequential damages, and waive the right to a jury trial.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="lgSection" id="contact">
      <h2>13. Sponsor Contact</h2>
      <p>For questions about any GoDoDaytona promotion:</p>
      <p><strong>GoDoCity LLC</strong><br>Daytona Beach, FL<br><a href="mailto:hello@gododaytona.com">hello@gododaytona.com</a></p>
    </div>

  </div>
</Base>

<style>
  .lgWrap { max-width: 760px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 56px 2rem 96px; }
  @media (max-width: 600px) { .lgWrap { padding: 40px 1.25rem 72px; } }
  .lgBread { font-size: 13px; color: #888; margin-bottom: 32px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .lgBread a { color: var(--brand1, #0077be); text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600; }
  .lgBread a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
  .lgBread span[aria-hidden] { color: #ccc; }
  .lgEyebrow { display: block; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 900; letter-spacing: .16em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--brand1, #0077be); margin-bottom: 10px; }
  .lgTitle { font-size: clamp(28px, 5vw, 42px); font-weight: 900; letter-spacing: -0.025em; color: #111; margin: 0 0 6px; line-height: 1.1; }
  .lgSubhead { font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700; color: #888; margin: 0 0 16px; }
  .lgMeta { font-size: 13px; color: #888; margin-bottom: 28px; display: flex; gap: 24px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .lgDivider { height: 1px; background: #e5e7eb; margin: 0 0 32px; }
  .lgNotice { background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--brand1, #0077be) 6%, white); border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--brand1, #0077be) 20%, transparent); border-radius: 10px; padding: 16px 18px; margin-bottom: 32px; }
  .lgNotice p { margin: 0; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.65; color: #333; }
  .lgToc { background: #f9f9fb; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius: 12px; padding: 20px 24px; margin-bottom: 52px; }
  .lgTocTitle { font-size: 11px; font-weight: 900; letter-spacing: .12em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #888; margin: 0 0 14px; }
  .lgTocList { list-style: decimal; padding-left: 18px; margin: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 7px; }
  .lgTocList a { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; color: #333; text-decoration: none; }
  .lgTocList a:hover { color: var(--brand1, #0077be); text-decoration: underline; }
  .lgSection { margin-bottom: 52px; }
  .lgSection h2 { font-size: clamp(17px, 2.5vw, 21px); font-weight: 900; letter-spacing: -0.01em; color: #111; margin: 0 0 18px; padding-bottom: 10px; border-bottom: 2px solid var(--brand1, #0077be); }
  .lgSection h3 { font-size: 15px; font-weight: 800; color: #111; margin: 22px 0 8px; }
  .lgSection p { font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.78; color: #444; margin: 0 0 14px; }
  .lgSection p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
  .lgSection ul, .lgSection ol { padding-left: 22px; margin: 0 0 16px; }
  .lgSection li { font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.72; color: #444; margin-bottom: 7px; }
  .lgSection a { color: var(--brand1, #0077be); text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 2px; }
  .lgSection strong { color: #111; }
  @media print { .lgWrap { padding: 0; } .lgBread { display: none; } }
</style>
